# 7. PROPOSED SYSTEM

The proposed Smart Parking System uses four HC-SR04 ultrasonic sensors connected to an Arduino UNO.

Each sensor is assigned to one parking slot.

```text
Slot 1 → Sensor 1
Slot 2 → Sensor 2
Slot 3 → Sensor 3
Slot 4 → Sensor 4
```

The Arduino measures the distance from each sensor to the detected object.

The system uses a configurable threshold of **15 cm** in the implemented prototype.

```text
Distance < 15 cm
        ↓
OCCUPIED

Distance ≥ 15 cm
        ↓
FREE
```

The controller counts the free slots and updates the LCD.

If:

```text
Available Slots = 0
```

the system displays:

```text
PARKING FULL
```

and activates the red LED and buzzer.

